{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-debugging","title":"高级调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/dap-protocol/advanced-debugging","wordCount":1166,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"高级调试\">高级调试</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>高级调试功能都在回答同一个问题：<strong>如何在「少暂停」「看得多」「能回退」之间取得更好的调试体验</strong>。基础断点每次都停，在高频代码里几乎不可用；而复杂的 bug 又需要更深的信息。这些功能各从不同角度缓解这一矛盾：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>缓解方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>条件断点</td>\n<td>只在条件为真时停（少停）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志点</td>\n<td>输出信息但不暂停（只看不停）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命中计数断点</td>\n<td>第 N 次命中才停（控制停的时机）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向调试</td>\n<td>回退到之前的状态（能回退）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多目标调试</td>\n<td>同时观察多个进程（看得多）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内联值</td>\n<td>行旁直接显示值（看得快）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>它们大多建立在基础断点机制之上，只是给断点附加了 <code>condition</code>、<code>hitCondition</code>、<code>logMessage</code> 等限制条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"条件断点\">条件断点</h2><p>条件断点只在指定条件为真时才暂停执行，避免在循环或高频代码中频繁暂停。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SourceBreakpoint {&#10;  line: number;&#10;  condition?: string;&#10;  hitCondition?: string;&#10;  logMessage?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const breakpoints: SourceBreakpoint[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    line: 42,&#10;    condition: &quot;user.role === &#39;admin&#39; &amp;&amp; user.id &gt; 100&quot;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    line: 58,&#10;    condition: &#39;items.length &gt; 1000&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SourceBreakpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  line</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  condition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hitCondition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  logMessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> breakpoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SourceBreakpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    line: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    condition: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user.role === 'admin' &#x26;&#x26; user.id > 100\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    line: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">58</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    condition: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'items.length > 1000'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    HIT[执行到断点行] --&gt; CHECK{条件求值}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|true| PAUSE[暂停执行]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|false| CONTINUE[继续执行]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|求值错误| ERROR[显示错误,继续执行]\">graph TD\n    HIT[执行到断点行] --&gt; CHECK{条件求值}\n    CHECK --&gt;|true| PAUSE[暂停执行]\n    CHECK --&gt;|false| CONTINUE[继续执行]\n    CHECK --&gt;|求值错误| ERROR[显示错误,继续执行]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>断点特性</th>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>表达式示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>条件断点</td>\n<td>condition</td>\n<td><code>user.id === 42</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命中计数</td>\n<td>hitCondition</td>\n<td><code>&gt; 10</code>、<code>== 100</code>、<code>% 5 == 0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志点</td>\n<td>logMessage</td>\n<td><code>User: {user.name}, ID: {id}</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>条件表达式的求值环境与被调试程序一致，可以使用当前作用域中的所有变量。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 条件断点的性能影响取决于调试器实现。某些调试器在引擎层面优化了条件求值（如 V8 的条件断点），而另一些则需要每次命中时通过 DAP 往返求值。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"日志点-logpoints\">日志点（Logpoints）</h2><p>日志点是一种不暂停执行的特殊断点，它在命中时输出日志消息到调试控制台。花括号中的表达式会被求值替换。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const logpoint: SourceBreakpoint = {&#10;  line: 35,&#10;  logMessage: &#39;Processing order #{order.id}, total: {order.total}, items: {order.items.length}&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> logpoint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SourceBreakpoint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  line: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  logMessage: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Processing order #{order.id}, total: {order.total}, items: {order.items.length}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant RT as 运行时&#10;    participant DA as 调试适配器&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;&#10;    RT-&gt;&gt;DA: 命中日志点 (line 35)&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;DA: 求值 logMessage 中的表达式&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;E: output event (category: &quot;console&quot;)&#10;    Note left of E: Debug Console:&lt;br/&gt;Processing order #42, total: 99.5, items: 3&#10;    Note right of RT: 继续执行,不暂停\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant RT as 运行时\n    participant DA as 调试适配器\n    participant E as 编辑器\n\n    RT-&gt;&gt;DA: 命中日志点 (line 35)\n    DA-&gt;&gt;DA: 求值 logMessage 中的表达式\n    DA-&gt;&gt;E: output event (category: \"console\")\n    Note left of E: Debug Console:&lt;br/&gt;Processing order #42, total: 99.5, items: 3\n    Note right of RT: 继续执行,不暂停</pre><p>日志点 vs 传统 console.log：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>日志点</th>\n<th>console.log</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>需要改代码</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重启要求</td>\n<td>无需重启</td>\n<td>通常需要重新编译运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能影响</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>IO 可能影响性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试后清理</td>\n<td>自动清理（不在代码中）</td>\n<td>容易忘记删除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出位置</td>\n<td>调试控制台</td>\n<td>stdout / 日志文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达式插值</td>\n<td><code>{expression}</code> 自动求值</td>\n<td>手动拼接字符串</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"命中计数断点\">命中计数断点</h2><p>命中计数断点在被命中特定次数后才暂停。<code>hitCondition</code> 支持多种比较表达式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const hitCountBreakpoints: SourceBreakpoint[] = [&#10;  { line: 20, hitCondition: &#39;== 100&#39; },&#10;  { line: 30, hitCondition: &#39;&gt; 50&#39; },&#10;  { line: 40, hitCondition: &#39;% 10 == 0&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> hitCountBreakpoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SourceBreakpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { line: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, hitCondition: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'== 100'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { line: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, hitCondition: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'> 50'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { line: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, hitCondition: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'% 10 == 0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hitCondition</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>暂停时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>== N</code></td>\n<td>等于 N 次</td>\n<td>第 N 次命中时暂停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&gt; N</code></td>\n<td>大于 N 次</td>\n<td>第 N+1 次起每次都暂停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&gt;= N</code></td>\n<td>大于等于 N 次</td>\n<td>第 N 次起每次都暂停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt; N</code></td>\n<td>小于 N 次</td>\n<td>前 N-1 次命中暂停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>% N == 0</code></td>\n<td>N 的倍数</td>\n<td>每 N 次命中暂停一次</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;hitCondition: &gt; 50&quot;&#10;        H1[&quot;命中 1-50 继续&quot;] --&gt; H51[&quot;命中 51 暂停&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;hitCondition: % 10 == 0&quot;&#10;        M1[&quot;命中 1-9 继续&quot;] --&gt; M10[&quot;命中 10 暂停&quot;] --&gt; M20[&quot;命中 20 暂停&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"hitCondition: &gt; 50\"\n        H1[\"命中 1-50 继续\"] --&gt; H51[\"命中 51 暂停\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"hitCondition: % 10 == 0\"\n        M1[\"命中 1-9 继续\"] --&gt; M10[\"命中 10 暂停\"] --&gt; M20[\"命中 20 暂停\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 条件断点和命中计数断点可以组合使用。同时设置 <code>condition</code> 和 <code>hitCondition</code> 时，只有条件为真的命中才计入命中计数。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"反向调试\">反向调试</h2><p>部分调试器支持反向执行（Time-Travel Debugging），允许用户回退到之前的执行状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Capabilities {&#10;  supportsStepBack?: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type ReverseCommands = &#39;reverseContinue&#39; | &#39;stepBack&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Capabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportsStepBack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReverseCommands</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reverseContinue'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'stepBack'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;    participant DA as 调试适配器&#10;&#10;    Note over U,DA: 程序暂停在 line 50&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;E: Step Back&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: stepBack (threadId: 1)&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;DA: 回退到上一个执行点&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped (reason: &quot;step&quot;)&#10;    Note over U,DA: 程序状态回到 line 48&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;E: Reverse Continue&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;DA: reverseContinue (threadId: 1)&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;DA: 反向执行到上一个断点&#10;    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped (reason: &quot;breakpoint&quot;)&#10;    Note over U,DA: 回退到之前命中的断点\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant E as 编辑器\n    participant DA as 调试适配器\n\n    Note over U,DA: 程序暂停在 line 50\n    U-&gt;&gt;E: Step Back\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: stepBack (threadId: 1)\n    DA-&gt;&gt;DA: 回退到上一个执行点\n    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped (reason: \"step\")\n    Note over U,DA: 程序状态回到 line 48\n    U-&gt;&gt;E: Reverse Continue\n    E-&gt;&gt;DA: reverseContinue (threadId: 1)\n    DA-&gt;&gt;DA: 反向执行到上一个断点\n    DA-&gt;&gt;E: stopped (reason: \"breakpoint\")\n    Note over U,DA: 回退到之前命中的断点</pre><p>支持反向调试的调试器：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调试器/工具</th>\n<th>技术实现</th>\n<th>语言支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>rr (Mozilla)</td>\n<td>系统调用录制与重放</td>\n<td>C/C++/Rust</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UndoDB</td>\n<td>商业级录制重放</td>\n<td>C/C++</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VS Time Travel</td>\n<td>WinDbg 时间旅行调试</td>\n<td>Windows 原生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node.js (实验)</td>\n<td>检查点快照</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"多目标调试\">多目标调试</h2><p>DAP 支持同时调试多个目标（如前端 + 后端、微服务集群），编辑器可以管理多个并行的调试会话。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;0.2.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;compounds&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Full Stack&quot;,&#10;      &quot;configurations&quot;: [&quot;Launch Server&quot;, &quot;Launch Client&quot;],&#10;      &quot;stopAll&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;preLaunchTask&quot;: &quot;npm: build&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;configurations&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;node&quot;,&#10;      &quot;request&quot;: &quot;launch&quot;,&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Launch Server&quot;,&#10;      &quot;program&quot;: &quot;${workspaceFolder}/server/index.ts&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;chrome&quot;,&#10;      &quot;request&quot;: &quot;launch&quot;,&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Launch Client&quot;,&#10;      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;http://localhost:3000&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.2.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compounds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Full Stack\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"configurations\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Launch Server\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Launch Client\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"stopAll\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"preLaunchTask\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"npm: build\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"configurations\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"request\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"launch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Launch Server\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"program\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"${workspaceFolder}/server/index.ts\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"chrome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"request\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"launch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Launch Client\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://localhost:3000\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    EDITOR[编辑器] --&gt; S1[会话 1: Node.js Server]&#10;    EDITOR --&gt; S2[会话 2: Chrome Client]&#10;    EDITOR --&gt; S3[会话 3: Worker Process]&#10;&#10;    S1 --&gt; DA1[Node Debug Adapter]&#10;    S2 --&gt; DA2[Chrome Debug Adapter]&#10;    S3 --&gt; DA3[Node Debug Adapter]&#10;&#10;    DA1 --&gt; P1[server process]&#10;    DA2 --&gt; P2[browser tab]&#10;    DA3 --&gt; P3[worker process]\">graph TD\n    EDITOR[编辑器] --&gt; S1[会话 1: Node.js Server]\n    EDITOR --&gt; S2[会话 2: Chrome Client]\n    EDITOR --&gt; S3[会话 3: Worker Process]\n\n    S1 --&gt; DA1[Node Debug Adapter]\n    S2 --&gt; DA2[Chrome Debug Adapter]\n    S3 --&gt; DA3[Node Debug Adapter]\n\n    DA1 --&gt; P1[server process]\n    DA2 --&gt; P2[browser tab]\n    DA3 --&gt; P3[worker process]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>多目标特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>compounds</td>\n<td>组合多个调试配置同时启动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>stopAll</td>\n<td>停止一个会话时是否停止所有关联会话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话切换</td>\n<td>调试工具栏的下拉菜单切换活动会话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨会话断点</td>\n<td>每个会话独立管理断点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统一调试控制台</td>\n<td>多个会话的输出汇聚到同一个控制台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内联值\">内联值</h2><p>内联值（Inline Values）在代码行旁直接显示变量的当前值，无需鼠标悬停或查看变量面板。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface InlineValuesProvider {&#10;  provideInlineValues(document: TextDocument, viewRange: Range, context: InlineValueContext): InlineValue[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;type InlineValue = InlineValueText | InlineValueVariableLookup | InlineValueEvaluatableExpression;&#10;&#10;interface InlineValueText {&#10;  range: Range;&#10;  text: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface InlineValueVariableLookup {&#10;  range: Range;&#10;  variableName?: string;&#10;  caseSensitiveLookup: boolean;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InlineValuesProvider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  provideInlineValues</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">document</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDocument</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">viewRange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InlineValueContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InlineValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InlineValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InlineValueText</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InlineValueVariableLookup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InlineValueEvaluatableExpression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InlineValueText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  range</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InlineValueVariableLookup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  range</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  variableName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  caseSensitiveLookup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;带内联值的编辑器视图&quot;&#10;        L1[&quot;const x = 10;                    // x = 10&quot;]&#10;        L2[&quot;const y = x * 2;                 // y = 20&quot;]&#10;        L3[&quot;const result = compute(x, y);    // result = {sum: 30, diff: -10}&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"带内联值的编辑器视图\"\n        L1[\"const x = 10;                    // x = 10\"]\n        L2[\"const y = x * 2;                 // y = 20\"]\n        L3[\"const result = compute(x, y);    // result = {sum: 30, diff: -10}\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内联值类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>InlineValueText</td>\n<td>直接显示固定文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>InlineValueVariableLookup</td>\n<td>按变量名查找并显示值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>InlineValueEvaluatable</td>\n<td>求值表达式并显示结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 内联值是 LSP 协议（非 DAP）的一部分，但通常在调试模式下激活。编辑器通过 <code>InlineValuesProvider</code> 确定在哪些位置显示什么内联值。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((高级调试))&#10;    条件断点&#10;      condition 表达式&#10;      当前作用域求值&#10;      性能因调试器而异&#10;    日志点&#10;      不暂停执行&#10;      花括号表达式插值&#10;      替代 console.log&#10;    命中计数&#10;      hitCondition 比较&#10;      可与条件组合&#10;      循环调试利器&#10;    反向调试&#10;      stepBack 回退&#10;      reverseContinue 反向&#10;      rr / UndoDB 工具&#10;    多目标调试&#10;      compounds 组合启动&#10;      独立会话管理&#10;      stopAll 联动停止\">mindmap\n  root((高级调试))\n    条件断点\n      condition 表达式\n      当前作用域求值\n      性能因调试器而异\n    日志点\n      不暂停执行\n      花括号表达式插值\n      替代 console.log\n    命中计数\n      hitCondition 比较\n      可与条件组合\n      循环调试利器\n    反向调试\n      stepBack 回退\n      reverseContinue 反向\n      rr / UndoDB 工具\n    多目标调试\n      compounds 组合启动\n      独立会话管理\n      stopAll 联动停止</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>条件断点</strong>只在条件表达式为真时暂停，<code>condition</code> 在被调试程序的作用域中求值。</li>\n<li><strong>日志点</strong>不暂停执行而输出日志，<code>{expression}</code> 语法支持动态表达式插值。</li>\n<li><strong>命中计数断点</strong>支持 <code>==</code>、<code>&gt;</code>、<code>%</code> 等比较运算，可与条件断点组合使用。</li>\n<li><strong>反向调试</strong>允许回退执行状态，需要 rr 或 UndoDB 等专用录制重放工具支持。</li>\n<li><strong>多目标调试</strong>通过 <code>compounds</code> 配置同时启动多个调试会话，<code>stopAll</code> 控制联动停止。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高级调试","id":"高级调试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"条件断点","id":"条件断点"},{"level":2,"text":"日志点（Logpoints）","id":"日志点-logpoints"},{"level":2,"text":"命中计数断点","id":"命中计数断点"},{"level":2,"text":"反向调试","id":"反向调试"},{"level":2,"text":"多目标调试","id":"多目标调试"},{"level":2,"text":"内联值","id":"内联值"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"变量检查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/dap-protocol/variable-inspection"},"next":{"title":"Tree-sitter 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/tree-sitter-ecosystem/tree-sitter-architecture"}}